        "text": "He bought six apples.",
        "notes": "[\u02c8\u0283\u025bst]\n\n\u0161est' is the cardinal number six in the nominative plural, agreeing with the plural noun jablk (apples)."
      },
      "presentation": "text_reading",
      "available_at": "2026-09-06T16:00:00Z",
      "scheduler_state": null,
      "schedule_previews": {
